m01_parity_strike_not_discounted.py | changed lines: 5 | first doc line: Parity uses the strike K instead of the discounted strike K df (both entry points).
m02_parity_sign_flipped.py | changed lines: 4 | first doc line: Parity gap sign flipped: parity_gap_cents returns the negated gap.
m03_cost_charged_once.py | changed lines: 4 | first doc line: Cost charged once per finding (one leg) instead of per leg (three legs).
m04_costs_ignored.py | changed lines: 4 | first doc line: Costs ignored: gross violations are reported as findings with no cost netting.
m05_no_ordering_check_input_order.py | changed lines: 4 | first doc line: Ordering not checked: convexity is computed in the input order of strikes, so shuffled strikes are accepted.
m06_convexity_first_difference.py | changed lines: 4 | first doc line: Convexity tested with the first difference: a violation is a call that falls between neighbours, not a second 
m07_rounding_truncates_toward_zero.py | changed lines: 4 | first doc line: Rounding by truncation toward zero instead of half up, so an exact half cent goes down in magnitude.
m08_df_read_as_parts_per_thousand.py | changed lines: 5 | first doc line: df_ppm read as parts per thousand: the discount factor is df_ppm / 1000.
m09_net_rule_at_least_zero.py | changed lines: 5 | first doc line: Net-of-cost rule uses >= 0: a finding whose net amount is exactly zero is kept.
m10_seed0_answer_hard_coded.py | changed lines: 5 | first doc line: Hard-coded answer: scan returns seed 0's findings for any chain.
m11_convexity_on_discounted_quotes.py | changed lines: 5 | first doc line: Convexity test run on call quotes discounted by df_ppm (P5 says quotes are present values, so no discounting):
m12_midpoint_chord_ignores_spacing.py | changed lines: 4 | first doc line: Convexity chord uses equal weights of one half on the two neighbours, which is wrong on an uneven strike grid.
m13_gross_rounds_half_even.py | changed lines: 3 | first doc line: Gross amount rounded with Python round(), which sends an exact half cent to the even cent, not up.
m14_convexity_skips_last_interior.py | changed lines: 3 | first doc line: Convexity scan stops one strike early, so a violation at the last interior strike is never reported.
m21_df_lower_bound_zero_accepted.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: df_ppm = 0 accepted, so the range lower bound is off by one (1 to 1000000 is the contract).
m22_df_upper_bound_one_too_high.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: df_ppm = 1000001 accepted, so the range upper bound is off by one.
m23_zero_strike_accepted_by_parity.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: parity_gap_cents accepts a strike of zero, because the check uses < instead of <=.
m24_convexity_flags_call_on_chord.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: a call exactly on the chord is flagged, so the test uses <= 0 instead of < 0.
m25_zero_net_finding_kept.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: a finding whose net amount is exactly zero is kept, so the net test uses >= 0 instead of > 0.
m26_negative_half_spread_accepted.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: a negative half-spread is accepted, because the cost check only looks at the fee.
m27_equal_weights_on_uneven_grid.py | changed lines: 3 | first doc line: Student error: the chord uses equal weights on the two neighbours, which is right only on an even grid.
m28_half_cent_gross_rounds_half_down.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: the gross of a half-cent tie rounds toward zero, so an exact 2.5 cents gives 2 instead of 3.
m29_parity_findings_in_reverse_strike_order.py | changed lines: 3 | first doc line: Student error: parity records are built from the strikes in reverse order, which breaks the required strike or
m30_puts_length_not_checked.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: the quote-length check ignores the put list, so a short put list is not rejected.
m41_cost_charged_on_two_legs.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: each finding is charged two legs of fee plus half-spread instead of three.
m42_convexity_gross_floored.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: the convexity gross is floored, so a 0.5-cent or 1.5-cent violation loses its half cent.
m43_convexity_findings_reversed.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: convexity findings are emitted in reverse strike order (the loop walks the indices backwards).
m44_convexity_explanation_without_P1.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: the convexity explanation omits the European-exercise label P1 it depends on.
m45_call_discounted_in_parity.py | changed lines: 6 | first doc line: Student error: the call is discounted by df in the parity gap, as if it were a payment at expiry.
m46_spread_charged_once.py | changed lines: 2 | first doc line: Student error: the half-spread is charged once per finding while the fee is charged on each of three legs.
