n02_parity_strike_divided_by_df.py | changed lines: 4 | first doc line: Parity gap discounts the strike by dividing by the discount factor instead of multiplying.
n03_negative_parity_gaps_skipped.py | changed lines: 5 | first doc line: Negative parity gaps are skipped, so only calls rich to the synthetic forward are reported.
n04_convexity_charged_one_leg_less.py | changed lines: 4 | first doc line: Convexity net charges two legs instead of three, so a finding one cost-leg too rich is kept.
